@api = http://localhost:5080

### 1. Pedir código (olhe o console da API para ver o código)
POST {{api}}/api/auth/request-code
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "seunome@ufpr.br" }

### 2. Conferir código
POST {{api}}/api/auth/verify-code
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "seunome@ufpr.br", "code": "000000" }

### 3. Cadastro (cole o signupToken do passo 2)
@signupToken = cole-aqui
POST {{api}}/api/auth/register
Authorization: Bearer {{signupToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Ana Ribeiro",
  "birthDate": "2004-03-10",
  "cpf": "529.982.247-25",
  "phone": "(41) 99999-0000",
  "course": "Direito",
  "period": 3,
  "shift": "Noite"
}

### 4. Meu perfil (cole o accessToken)
@token = cole-aqui
GET {{api}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4a. Trocar o campus do atalho "Minha faculdade" (ids em GET /api/universities)
PUT {{api}}/api/users/me/campus
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "campusId": 2 }

### 4b. Configurações (tema System | Light | Dark)
GET {{api}}/api/users/me/preferences
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
PUT {{api}}/api/users/me/preferences
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "theme": "Dark", "rideAlerts": true, "alwaysShareTrip": false, "showCourse": true }

### 4c. Casa: 404 home_not_set na primeira vez
GET {{api}}/api/me/places/home
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Definir casa (mande o que veio de GET /api/places/{id})
PUT {{api}}/api/me/places/home
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "address": "R. Bispo Dom José, 2000 - Batel, Curitiba - PR",
  "neighborhood": "Batel",
  "googlePlaceId": "ChIJ...",
  "latitude": -25.4420,
  "longitude": -49.2890
}

###
DELETE {{api}}/api/me/places/home
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Buscar endereço (precisa da chave do Google)
GET {{api}}/api/places/autocomplete?q=hospital%20cajuru&session=11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. Preço de uma rota (PUCPR -> UFPR Politécnico)
POST {{api}}/api/quote
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "originLat": -25.4517, "originLng": -49.2513, "destinationLat": -25.4507, "destinationLng": -49.2316 }
